{"list_html":"  <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured\" data-anim=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-media\" data-media-type=\"image\">\n              <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__image\"\n          src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Temoignage_IM_Projet_200kb.jpg\"\n          alt=\"IM Projet fit-out project by Ronnsquare\"\n          loading=\"lazy\">\n          <\/div>\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-content\">\n              <blockquote class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-quote\">&ldquo;Ronnsquare quickly understood our needs and carefully took all of our requests and requirements into account&rdquo;<\/blockquote>\n            <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author\">\n                  <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-avatar\" src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Philippe_Regis_IM_Projet_200kb.jpg\" alt=\"Philippe  R\u00e9gis\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author-info\">\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-name\">Philippe  R\u00e9gis<\/span>\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-role\">President \u2013 IM Projet<\/span>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured\" data-anim=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-media\" data-media-type=\"image\">\n              <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__image\"\n          src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Temoignage_Naarea_2_200kb.jpg\"\n          alt=\"Naarea fit-out project by Ronnsquare\"\n          loading=\"lazy\">\n          <\/div>\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-content\">\n              <blockquote class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-quote\">&ldquo;Ronnsquare is a reliable company that respects its clients and listens carefully to their needs. Their expertise in construction management is a key strength that greatly contributed to the success of our fit-out project&rdquo;<\/blockquote>\n            <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author\">\n                  <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-avatar\" src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Jean-Marc-Magnet-Naarea.png\" alt=\"Jean-Marc Magnet\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author-info\">\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-name\">Jean-Marc Magnet<\/span>\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-role\">Real Estate Director \u2013 Naarea<\/span>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured\" data-anim=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-media\" data-media-type=\"image\">\n              <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__image\"\n          src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Temoignage_Merz_Aesthetics_1_200kb.jpg\"\n          alt=\"Merz Aesthetics fit-out project by Ronnsquare\"\n          loading=\"lazy\">\n          <\/div>\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-content\">\n              <blockquote class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-quote\">&ldquo;We even invited our European colleagues to visit, and they were envious of our offices, which now serve as a benchmark for other Merz Aesthetics subsidiaries across Europe&rdquo;<\/blockquote>\n            <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author\">\n                  <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-avatar\" src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Nicolas_de_La_Hosseraye_Merz_Aesthetics_200kb.png\" alt=\"Nicolas de La Hosseraye\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author-info\">\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-name\">Nicolas de La Hosseraye<\/span>\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-role\">Chief Executive Officer \u2013 Merz Aesthetics<\/span>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured\" data-anim=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-media\" data-media-type=\"image\">\n              <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__image\"\n          src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Temoignage_Groupe_Pharma_3_200kb.jpg\"\n          alt=\"A pharmaceutical group&#039;s fit-out project by Ronnsquare\"\n          loading=\"lazy\">\n          <\/div>\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-content\">\n              <blockquote class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-quote\">&ldquo;Ronnsquare took on the challenge and delivered successfully: spacious, light-filled workspaces with excellent acoustic performance. In fact, everyone loved it\u2014it was perfect&rdquo;<\/blockquote>\n            <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author\">\n                  <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-avatar\" src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Office_manager_Groupe_Pharmaceutique_200kb.png\" alt=\"Confidential\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author-info\">\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-name\">Confidential<\/span>\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-role\">Office Manager \u2013 Pharmaceutical Group<\/span>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured\" data-anim=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-media\" data-media-type=\"image\">\n              <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__image\"\n          src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Temoignage_Rodl_200kb-1.jpg\"\n          alt=\"R\u00f6dl &amp; Partner fit-out project by Ronnsquare\"\n          loading=\"lazy\">\n          <\/div>\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-content\">\n              <blockquote class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-quote\">&ldquo;I quickly felt that Ronnsquare truly understood the project: not to disrupt or dismantle what already exists, but to create a more welcoming environment with additional space for employees&rdquo;<\/blockquote>\n            <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author\">\n                  <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-avatar\" src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Nicola_Lohrey_Rodl_Partner_200kb.png\" alt=\"Nicola Lohrey\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author-info\">\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-name\">Nicola Lohrey<\/span>\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-role\">Managing Partner \u2013 R\u00f6dl &amp; Partner<\/span>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n","pagination_html":"    <nav class=\"block-11-1-reviews__pagination\" aria-label=\"Testimonials pagination\">\n              <button type=\"button\" class=\"block-11-1-reviews__page block-11-1-reviews__page--prev\" data-page=\"8\">\n          <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&larr;<\/span> Previous        <\/button>\n      \n                        <button type=\"button\" class=\"block-11-1-reviews__page\" data-page=\"1\">1<\/button>\n                                <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__page block-11-1-reviews__ellipsis\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2026<\/span>\n                                <button type=\"button\" class=\"block-11-1-reviews__page\" data-page=\"8\">8<\/button>\n                                <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__page is-current\" aria-current=\"page\">9<\/span>\n              \n              <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__page block-11-1-reviews__page--next is-disabled\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          Next <span>&rarr;<\/span>\n        <\/span>\n          <\/nav>\n    ","paged":9,"total_pages":9,"total":53}